{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0175WUhYFduEd1TDWSnn5bs6","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2025 review form scoring criteria acceptance rate\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Survey - Speaker Deck\",\"url\":\"https://speakerdeck.com/harukiabe/corl-2025-survey\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"The AI Review Lottery: Widespread AI-Assisted Peer Reviews Boost Paper   Scores and Acceptance Rates\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.02150\"},{\"title\":\"What Drives Paper Acceptance? A Process-Centric Analysis of Modern Peer Review\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.25701\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer agreement trends from four years of electronic submissions of conference abstract\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC1473196/\"},{\"title\":\"ReviewerToo: Should AI Join The Program Committee? A Look At The Future of Peer Review\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.08867\"},{\"title\":\"Can LLM feedback enhance review quality? A randomized study of 20K   reviews at ICLR 2025\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2504.09737\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, I found limited specific information about CoRL 2025's review form scoring criteria and acceptance rate. The search results primarily contain information about other conferences and general peer review studies, rather than the specific CoRL 2025 review guidelines you're looking for.\n\nThe only direct mention of CoRL 2025 in the results is from a survey presentation that references \"What is CoRL / Participation scale & acceptance / Industry exhibitions,\" but the actual scoring criteria and acceptance rate details are not provided in the search results.\n\nTo get the specific information you're looking for regarding:\n- CoRL 2025 review form scoring criteria\n- CoRL 2025 acceptance rate\n\nI recomm