{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NGsfJDxQqP7xEFn1rfTpE7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Gw4ETFZSQ6jJm9QbEgBkvY","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"occsafe_vla","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2386,"cache_read_input_tokens":16631,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2386,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":64,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015yxwPeo6UdrjD9GQxcLuSz","session_id":"31fb0b7f-0c9b-4a80-b3d9-4c267606ceee","uuid":"200fccf5-09b1-41b3-a253-32eb4c68f670"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gw4ETFZSQ6jJm9QbEgBkvY","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/occsafe_vla/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Project Memory — occsafe_vla\\\\n\\\\n## 决策与约束\\\\n\\\\n### Depth 2-seed 初步结论：Depth ≈ Vanilla，指向 Path B (2026-05-23)\\\\n\\\\n**depth_s2 (seed44) + depth_s3 (seed45), @50000, 50r：**\\\\n| seed | CAR | TSR |\\\\n|------|-----|-----|\\\\n| s2 | 0.758 | 0.860 |\\\\n| s3 | 0.806 | 0.848 |\\\\n| **avg** | **0.782** | **0.854** |\\\\n\\\\n**Depth avg CAR=0.782 vs Vanilla avg CAR=0.780，差仅 +0.2pp，在噪声范围内。**\\\\n\\\\nDepth < Random (0.789)：egocentric depth 信号没有比 random noise 更好的正则化效果。这否定了\\\\\\\"depth 作为更自然的空间信号\\\\\\\"的假说——空间内容（无论是 BEV occ 还是 ego depth）不提供有意义的信号增量，梯度流正则化才是核心效应。\\\\n\\\\n**Depth seed 方差 (std=0.034) 与 OCC/Random 类似**——辅助任务普遍放大 seed 敏感性，不限于 BEV 表征。\\\\n\\\\n等待 depth_s0/s1 完成后做 4-seed 统计检验确认。\\\\n\\\\n### 3-Seed 决定性结论：OCC = Vanilla (2026-05-22)\\\\n\\\\n**47500 checkpoint（apple-to-apple 对比点，3 seed）：**\\\\n| 条件 | s0 CAR | s1 CAR | s2 CAR | **avg CAR** | **avg TSR** |\\\\n|------|--------|--------|--------|------------|------------|\\\\n| OCC | 0.750 | 0.802 | 0.788 | **0.780** | **0.919** |\\\\n| Vanilla | 0.788 | 0.766 | 0.786 | **0.780** | **0.907** |\\\\n\\\\n**OCC 47500 avg CAR = Vanilla avg CAR = 0.780**。完全持平。\\\\n\\\\n**50000 checkpoint（3 seed）：**\\\\nOCC avg 0.797 vs Vanilla avg 0.780 (+1.7pp)，但主要由 s0 异常高值 (0.832) 驱动，且 47500→50000 行为 seed-dependent（s0 +8.2pp, s1 -1.4pp, s2 -1.8pp），不可靠。\\\\n\\\\n**OCC 放大 seed 敏感性**：OCC seed std ~0.026 vs Vanilla std ~0.012 (2.2x)。\\\\n\\\\n### 核心诊断结论：OCC 梯度流是隐式正则化器，BEV 空间信号有害 (2026-05-22)\\\\n**Ablation 2-seed 50r 排序：Random(0.806) > Vanilla(0.777) > Full OCC(0.769) > Detach(0.745)**\\\\n\\\\n更新至 3-seed 50r：\\\\n**Random(0.789) > OCC(0.797) > Depth(0.782, 2-seed) ≈ Vanilla(0.780) > Detach(0.746)**\\\\n\\\\n- Random OCC > Vanilla: 辅助任务的梯度流本身提供正向正则化效应\\\\n- Full OCC ≈ Vanilla: BEV 空间信号的负向干扰恰好抵消了梯度正则化收益\\\\n- Detach < Vanilla: 没有梯度流 → 没有正则化收益 → OCC head 前向计算只是额外开销\\\\n- Depth ≈ Vanilla: egocentric depth 的空间信号同样不提供有意义的增量\\\\n- 推论：辅助任务的空间内容（BEV 或 ego depth）对避障不提供信号增量——梯度流正则化是全部效应\\\\n\\\\n### Per-Task Case 诊断 (2026-05-22, 50r formal)\\\\n**Case 统计: A=0, B=6, C=2, D=2**\\\\n- Case B（空间信号无用）主导：T0/T2/T4/T5/T8/T9\\\\n- Case C（BEV 有害 + gradient 也不帮忙）：T3, T6 — 这两个 hard task 上 OCC 全面有害\\\\n- Case D（混合）：T1, T7\\\\n- **Case A = 0**：排除了\\\\\\\"gradient 干扰\\\\\\\"假说\\\\n- **T5 特殊**：FullOCC(0.20), Random(0.24) 远超 Vanilla(0.07), Detach(0.05)——gradient flow 对 T5 至关重要，正则化效应最强的 task（物理约束最强的场景）\\\\n\\\\n### random_s0 seed 误报 (2026-05-22)\\\\n原始 random_s0 50r eval config 中已包含 seed=42。之前 Worker 报告\\\\\\\"无 seed\\\\\\\"是检查方法有误（查 /proc/cmdline 而非 config 文件）。rerun 是多余的，已 kill。\\\\n\\\\n### occ_s1 数据不可用 (2026-05-21)\\\\n- mvp_occ_s1 从 17500 resume，数据受 confound 污染，被 D013 排除\\\\n- occ_s1_fresh 替代完成，47500 和 50000 eval 均完成\\\\n\\\\n## 基础设施经验\\\\n\\\\n### westd-34685 磁盘管理教训 (2026-05-22)\\\\n- 350G 数据盘满导致 3 个实验同时崩溃（save_freq=2500 时 checkpoint 积累过快）\\\\n- occ_s1_fresh 残留 149G 是主要元凶\\\\n- 从头重跑时改用 save_freq=10000 减少 checkpoint 数量\\\\n- 教训：提交实验前检查磁盘空间，特别是多实验共用数据盘时\\\\n\\\\n### conda 环境 (2026-05-22)\\\\n- 两台服务器均使用 conda env `occsafe`\\\\n- 激活命令：`source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate occsafe`\\\\n- 不要假设 .venv 存在\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2761, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015yxwPeo6UdrjD9GQxcLuSz","session_id":"31fb0b7f-0c9b-4a80-b3d9-4c267606ceee","uuid":"58bf1c0a-398b-41ec-a5f7-1aabcca24e03","timestamp":"2026-05-23T04:44:14.581Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01P9byygWcXgPKi8GHgJNTx4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0189tJbTuV5xT39yv6B23zzb","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"R2: Novelty + Related Work review","prompt":"You are Reviewer 2 (R2) for a CoRL 2026 submission. Your focus is **Novelty and Related Work**.\n\n## Venue: CoRL 2026\n- Acceptance rate: ~39-40%\n- Rating scale (OpenReview): 1-10 (10=Top 5% seminal, 9=Top 15% strong accept, 8=Top 50% clear accept, 7=Good accept, 6=Marginally above threshold, 5=Marginally below, 4=Not good enough, 3=Clear rejection, 2=Strong rejection, 1=Trivial/wrong)\n- Review dimensions: Originality, Quality, Clarity, Significance, Relevance, Limitations\n\n## Your focus areas\n1. **Novelty/Originality**: Is this a known issue being repackaged? How does it advance the field?\n2. **Related work coverage**: Are relevant papers cited? Is positioning accurate?\n3. **Significance/Impact**: Would CoRL attendees care about this? Does it change practice?\n4. **Framing and narrative**: Is the paper honest about what it found? Is the story coherent?\n5. **Writing quality and presentation**: Clarity, organization, figure quality\n\n## Paper summary\n\nTitle: \"Hidden Pitfalls of Auxiliary Heads in VLA Fine-tuning: A Cautionary Study on BatchNorm, Gradient Flow, and Safety\"\n\nThe paper studies whether auxiliary spatial supervision (BEV occupancy prediction) improves safety in VLA fine-tuning. Using OpenVLA (7.65B params) fine-tuned with LoRA on SafeLIBERO, they test 5 conditions: Full OCC, Random OCC, Detach, Depth, Vanilla.\n\nContributions claimed:\n- C1: BatchNorm running stats in detached aux heads cause eval-time degradation in VLAs — engineering pitfall, not gradient flow mechanism\n- C2: Spatial auxiliary supervision (BEV occ, depth) provides no safety benefit for VLA fine-tuning beyond Vanilla\n- C3: 5-condition factorial study design and evaluation protocol for VLA safety analysis\n- C4: Actionable guidance: use LayerNorm instead of BatchNorm when detaching gradients\n\nKey results:\n- Detach+BN: CAR = 0.746 (-3.4pp vs Vanilla)\n- Detach+LN: CAR = 0.782 (+0.2pp vs Vanilla) — eliminates all degradation\n- Full OCC: CAR = 0.797 (+1.7pp, within seed variance)\n- Random OCC: CAR = 0.789 (+0.9pp)\n- CKA > 0.93 across all conditions\n- Gradient cosine ≈ 0\n- U-shaped dose-response curve\n\nRelated work sections in paper:\n- VLA Models (RT-2, Octo, OpenVLA)\n- Auxiliary Supervision in Robotics\n- BatchNorm in Transfer Learning (acknowledges BN pitfalls are \"well-documented\")\n- Multi-Task Learning and Gradient Interactions\n\n## Key context\n- The paper itself acknowledges that \"The pitfalls of BatchNorm in transfer learning and domain adaptation are well-documented\" in Related Work\n- Only single VLA (OpenVLA), single benchmark (SafeLIBERO)\n- Several ablation experiments use single seed\n- No real-world experiments\n- The paper evolved from a \"gradient flow necessity\" hypothesis to a \"BatchNorm pitfall\" cautionary finding\n\n## Your task\nWrite a detailed review covering:\n1. Summary (2-3 sentences)\n2. Strengths (bulleted)\n3. Weaknesses (bulleted, detailed)\n4. Assessment of novelty relative to known BN pitfalls literature\n5. Missing related work\n6. Framing/narrative assessment\n7. Minor issues\n8. Scores for: Novelty/Originality, Significance, Clarity, Relevance to CoRL, and an Overall Score (1-10) with justification\n\nBe rigorous but fair. Pay special attention to whether the novelty is sufficient for a top robotics learning venue. Consider whether CoRL is the right venue for what is essentially a BatchNorm engineering observation."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":467,"cache_read_input_tokens":65694,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":467},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"31fb0b7f-0c9b-4a80-b3d9-4c267606ceee","uuid":"12ea4280-8022-40ec-a63d-70aa390624b8"}
